    "Lucina is in the share sheet. To keep her first: Share → scroll the app row to the end → More → Edit → add Lucina to Favorites and drag her to the top. iOS orders the rest by how often you use them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lucina is in the share sheet. To keep her first: Share → scroll the app row to the end → More → Edit → add Lucina to Favorites and drag her to the top. iOS orders the rest by how often you use them."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lucina è nel menu di condivisione. Per tenerla al primo posto: Condividi → scorri la riga delle app fino in fondo → Altro → Modifica → aggiungi Lucina ai Preferiti e trascinala in cima. iOS ordina le altre app in base alla frequenza d'uso."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lucina er i delingsmenuen. Sådan holder du hende øverst: Del → rul til slutningen af apprækken → Mere → Rediger → føj Lucina til Favoritter, og træk hende til toppen. iOS sorterer resten efter, hvor ofte du bruger dem."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
